2026-10-13T12:24:09.5241379Z ##[error]Process completed with exit code 1.

# Cause (writer): the fresh target holds Supabase's default privileges for postgres in public (all to anon,
# authenticated, service_role). pg_restore creates each object as postgres, so it receives them; the night's ACL entries
# are written against the built-in default and never revoke anon. Reproduced on a local PG16 copy; fixed in the drill by
# clearing the restoring role's default privileges before the restore (the night's own are restored last).
